{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act30side_level_act30side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act30side",
  "stageId": "act30side_01",
  "title": "注意事项",
  "storyCode": "RS-1",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e75f9d7c9c1ef775d3be3e9ac43907e02a4bb55b20f774ae7ed226430543cd29",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我的记忆中有一片茫茫白雪。\n我记得小的时候，我躺在木头做的小床上，屋内壁炉里的柴火噼啪作响，窗外漫天大雪彻夜不停。\n风声在耳畔呼呼作响，一只大手抚着我的头，有人低声哄我入睡。\n我就在暖暖的安心感中沉入梦乡。\n我曾一度以为，那是乌萨斯。\n妈妈却告诉我，不是的，罗莎琳，那不是乌萨斯。\n那是谢拉格的风。\n那是谢拉格的雪。\n那是......我出生的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "所以......罗莎琳你是一直到上高等学校，才知道自己其实是在谢拉格出生的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "对啊，我妈之前完全没提过还有这回事，最开始我还以为她在开玩笑呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "小时候的事我都忘得差不多了，就记得到处都是雪......乌萨斯不也到处都是雪嘛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "这谁分得清。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "唔，这么说的话确实是有几分相似。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "不过在我的记忆里，乌萨斯比谢拉格要更冷点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "啊......这倒是没错，确实还是乌萨斯更冷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "大叔你也去过乌萨斯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "哈哈，都是好多年前的事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "那时候没什么机会好好逛逛，可惜了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "那你下回再来，我给你当向导。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "乌萨斯别的不说，圣骏堡的景色还是一等一的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "那太好了，呃，看来我得多准备两件厚外套。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "在有机会去乌萨斯赴约之前，还是先让我为罗莎琳小姐做向导吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "那么，就先说说这趟车的目的地——新建的那座耶拉冈德像。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "它就建在银心湖的湖心岛上，十分显眼，一出车站立刻就能看到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "当然，对罗莎琳你来说，耶拉冈德像还不是重点......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "你的这趟谢拉格之旅，有比观光更重要的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "对。没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我要先替我妈看一眼耶拉冈德像，这是她......她走之前强调过的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "然后我就转道去银心湖旁边的那座山。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我得把这个盒子里的东西，送到那座山的山顶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "这里面是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我也不知道，我妈没和我说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "她只让我把这个丢到那座山上，这样她就能心满意足了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "孤身一人回到陌生的故乡，只为完成母亲的愿望......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "多么孝顺，多么好的孩子，真是令人感动！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "呃，也没有你说的这么夸张啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "那么，在那之后罗莎琳你的计划是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "把东西送上山之后？没什么具体的计划，可能四处逛逛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "也有可能......会去找我爹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "你的父亲还在谢拉格？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "若是寻人，或许我能帮得上忙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "真的吗？可是我不知道他的名字，也记不得他长啥样了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "不过我妈和我说过，我爹长得很好看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "啊哈，一位美男子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "没错！据说是当时谢拉格有名有姓的美男子，好像还挺有名气的嘞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "对了，我妈还说过，我的眼睛最像我爹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "谢拉格的有名人？美男子？唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "有人选？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "如果那位先生能生出罗莎琳你这个年纪的女儿，那么只能是在维多利亚留学期间......唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "不，不不不。再怎么说也......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "当时，乌萨斯，难道说......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "到底怎么说？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "呃，哈哈，我得再寻思寻思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "要是能找到他那最好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "来一场令人感动的父女相认？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "啧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "不太一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "我只是要看看，这个十多年没出现的混账东西到底是个什么样的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列车员",
      "text": "欢迎各位乘坐最新的“圣女号”列车，我们的列车正处于正常行驶中，您可以透过两侧的车窗观赏谢拉格美丽的自然风光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列车员",
      "text": "在列车行驶过程中，我们还将在车内特别开展谢拉格当地特产的售卖活动！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列车员",
      "text": "谢拉格特色奶酪零食及人气驮兽盲盒均有贩卖，更有喀兰贸易公司推出的精装版高山雪水限量发售，产地直销，圣女严选，品质有保障！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列车员",
      "text": "有需要的乘客可以自由选购......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "不好意思，请问一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列车员",
      "text": "啊，这位乘客，请问您想来点什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "我不是要看商品......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列车员",
      "text": "您不要看普通商品？那这款精装版高山雪水要看一下吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列车员",
      "text": "这款产品是三族议会的指定用水，圣女大人也非常喜爱呢，我们这趟车到货不多，非常难得，现在购买仅需四弗朗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看热闹的乘客",
      "text": "嘶......四弗朗？这都够我下馆子请客吃一顿了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列车员",
      "text": "虽然是贵了一点，但您看这包装，这纯净的感觉，特别符合先生您的气质！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "......不必了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "就要......这个盲盒吧，谢谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列车员",
      "text": "谢谢惠顾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "距离下一站到站还有多长时间？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列车员",
      "text": "本次列车为直达列车，下一站就是终点站银心湖了，中间不会停靠其他站。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列车员",
      "text": "距离到站还有两个小时！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列车员",
      "text": "如果想在中途下车，更加深入地观览沿线的风光，我们的线路上也有每站停车的车次可供选择！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "好的，谢谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列车员",
      "text": "不客气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "（......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "（盲盒？这小东西这么受欢迎吗？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "（不管怎么看，都只不过是个没什么意思的小摆件罢了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "（......还有两个小时，时间足够了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "（接下来......嗯？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出逃的羽兽",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "羽兽？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出逃的羽兽",
      "text": "（狠啄）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "什么......？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出逃的羽兽们",
      "text": "（满地乱飞）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出逃的羽兽们",
      "text": "（四处攻击）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "出逃的羽兽们",
      "text": "嘎——嘎嘎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吃惊的老乡",
      "text": "哎，我的羽兽！我的羽兽怎么都跑出来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "热心的老乡",
      "text": "哪儿呢！我来帮你抓！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的老乡",
      "text": "我也来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "淘气的小孩",
      "text": "妈妈，我也想去抓羽兽！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "（......不好。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "淘气的小孩",
      "text": "啊，叔叔！叔叔你要去哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "淘气的小孩",
      "text": "叔叔也一起来帮忙好不好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "淘气的小孩",
      "text": "抓羽兽可好玩了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "............",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "（......呼。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "（小小羽兽和幼儿相加，竟会有如此威力。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "（谢拉格确实不可小觑。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "（不过，这倒正好给了我一个检查车厢的正当理由。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "下午好，先生们，请问这里有人看到过逃走的羽兽吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "没有？好的，抱歉打扰了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "（没有异常。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "（前面的车厢都没有可疑之处，现在只剩下最后几个包厢。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "（看来这次很可能又是白跑一趟了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "打扰一下，请问......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "......要是找到人，我要和他算算这十多年的账！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "看这个，在来之前我拜托娜塔莉娅和安娜......就是我的两个朋友，我拜托她们都帮我算好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "生活费、教育费、医疗费，哦对还有情感缺席费——娜塔莉娅特别提出来的——都列出来在这了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "就算长得再帅也不顶用！脸又不能当饭吃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈，情感缺席费，不错，真不错，我支持！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嗯？哪位，请......\n进......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怪帽子外国佬",
      "text": "......请问这里有人看到过逃走的羽兽吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "羽兽？哦，之前确实看到了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "啊对对对！我们确实看到了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "这位先生，来来来，我们出去详细说说羽兽的事儿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "啊？这有什么好详细说的，哎——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "搞啥啊，奇奇怪怪的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "text": "嗯......维多利亚啊。但愿没什么大事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "好啦，先生，现在咱们聊聊羽兽？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "我很好奇，什么样的羽兽，才能劳动“灰礼帽”亲自来找。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "没想到子爵阁下也在车上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "哦，算了吧，先生，这是我的台词。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "我怎么不知道，“灰礼帽”什么时候也开始对观光感兴趣了。难道说......是你的提前退休申请终于被批准了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "看来还没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "子爵阁下不必如此试探。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "我不过隐约听到一些风声，按照惯例排查而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "这话我可不敢轻易相信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "您与我同为公爵阁下分忧，彼此应该多些信任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "子爵阁下又为什么会出现在这里？刚刚在您身边的那位女士......是一名乌萨斯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "那位女士看起来似乎有点眼熟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "“灰礼帽”......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "我必须要说，你这种搭讪女士的方式很过时。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "......不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "我并没有这个意思，但还是感谢提醒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "至于我，自然是为了观光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "嘿，注意你的语气，“多些信任”！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "两天后就是耶拉冈德像的落成仪式，邀请函都送到我这来了，提前参观一下也是应有之义。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "我还买了两个圣女小雕像，准备当天一起带去，那东西做得挺好看的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "好了，聊天时间结束，我这里没有什么......“羽兽”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "text": "你也该继续工作了，“灰礼帽”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "您也一样，子爵阁下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "希望您没有忘记我们为什么会在这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "（这是最后一间。没有其他异常。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "（除了，克雷加文子爵和他身边的那个女孩......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "（出现在子爵身边......她会是什么身份？看来回去之后，应该好好查一查。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "（不过，现在还是先查完这一间——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "打扰——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "失礼了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "不，不可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "情报里提到那个人正在山中训练新兵，不可能会在这里出现。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "应该不会是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "有事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "有事就说，开门好玩？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "（——？！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "（竟然真的是她......？！那个希瓦艾什家的黑骑士......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "（还有手上的血迹，是谁让她动手了？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "（......有麻烦了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "（不过，这也说明情报没有错，这条线路上的列车确实有问题。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "不，在考虑这个问题之前......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "这一批负责观察锏的行动的情报员是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "啊，找到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "竟然连这样重要的情报都没能掌握，这几个人，等着去军事法庭作报告吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "你说情报员？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "别怪他们，能追上我的人不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "text": "感谢您为他们说话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "实话而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "说吧，你在这做什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "你应该不会还没想好理由吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "text": "“灰礼帽”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
